    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43360" root="لقف" body-key="l">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَقِفَهُ</span></b>  <i>He seized it,</i> or <i>took it quickly;</i> (S, M,
K;) namely, a thing thrown to him with the
hand, or said to him. (M, TA.) See also last
sentence of 1 in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حنك</span>.

